BlackGlass Kvantum theme (BlackGlass.kvconfig, BlackGlass.svg)

The kvconfig section layout and keys follow the KvMojave theme by Tsu Jan,
part of Kvantum (https://github.com/tsujan/Kvantum). The SVG artwork is new.

